msgid "maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.describe"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.describe:1 of
msgid "Generate descriptive statistics per group."
msgstr "为每个组生成描述性统计。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.describe.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.describe:3 of
msgid ""
"Percentiles to compute, in ``[0, 1]``.  Must be unique and exclude 0 and "
"1 (covered by min/max).  Unsorted input is silently sorted ascending "
"(matching pandas)."
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.describe:7 of
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If True, only numeric columns are described.  If False, both numeric and "
"datetime columns are included.  For datetime columns, ``count``, "
"``mean``, and ``std`` emit ``NaT``; ``min``, percentiles, and ``max`` "
"pass through as timestamps."
msgstr "如果为 True，仅描述数值列。如果为 False，同时包含数值列和日期时间列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.describe:12 of
msgid "Additional keyword arguments forwarded to :meth:`agg`."
msgstr "转发给 :meth:`agg` 的附加关键字参数。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.describe.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.groupby.core.LiteFrameGroupBy.describe:14 of
msgid ""
"Long-format frame with group keys, a ``statistic`` column, and one column"
" per data column."
msgstr "包含分组键、``statistic`` 列和每个数据列一列的长格式帧。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.groupby.LiteFrameGroupBy.describe.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

